                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStep 1: Research the symptoms of the patient. Flat topped violaceous papules, thinning of nails and onycholysis are all symptoms of psoriasis.\n\nStep 2: Research the microscopic findings of psoriasis.\n\nStep 3: Compare the microscopic findings of psoriasis to the answer choices.\n\nAnswer: B) Suprabasal split",
