                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Dapsone is a glucocorticoid that acts by inhibiting protein synthesis. Dapsone is used for treatment of bacterial and fungal infections as well as for immunomodulatory actions. The mechanism of dapsone for these indication is inhibition of protein synthesis. The answer: C.",
