                    {
                        "id": "3002f877-f7e5-48e6-830d-d4d61832e5eb",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": "qa-12",
                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nThe best test for assessment of intestinal malabsorption is A) Fecal fat estimation.\n\nIntestinal malabsorption is a condition in which the small intestine is unable to absorb nutrients from food. This can be caused by a variety of factors, including celiac disease, Crohn's disease, and pancreatic insufficiency.\n\nFecal fat estimation is a test that measures the amount of fat in a person's stool. This test is used to diagnose malabsorption because it can detect the presence of undigested fat in the stool, which is an indication that the small intestine is not properly absorbing nutrients.\n\nSerum lactose levels measure the amount of lactose in the blood, which can be used to diagnose lactose intolerance. However, this test is not useful for diagnosing malabsorption because lactose intolerance is not necessarily indicative of malabsorption.\n\nSerum amylase levels measure the amount of amylase in the blood, which can be used to diagnose pancreatic insufficiency. However, this test is not useful for diagnosing malabsorption because pancreatic insufficiency is not necessarily indicative of malabsorption.\n\nThe NBT-PABA test is a test that measures the amount of nitroblue tetrazolium (NBT) and para-aminobenzoic acid (PABA) in the urine. This test is used to diagnose certain types of bacterial infections, but it is not useful for diagnosing malabsorption.\n\nTherefore, the best test for assessment of intestinal malabsorption is A) Fecal fat estimation.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "e3a15b11-6ffd-4bdf-8c91-94bd7730f15e",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": " A.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "A",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
                        "author": "thoughtsource",
                        "date": "2023/04/17 14:35:27",
