                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "A) Serotonin, as it is the substance that mediates the Bezold-Jarisch reflex by activating the receptors that trigger this reflex.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "A",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
