                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStep 1: Research the Bezold-Jarisch reflex.\n\nStep 2: Look for information about what mediates the Bezold-Jarisch reflex.\n\nStep 3: Compare the available options (A, B, C, and D) to the information found in Step 2.\n\nAnswer: D) Histamine",
