                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nThe Bezold-Jarisch reflex is a physiological response to a decrease in blood pressure. It is mediated by the vagus nerve, which is part of the parasympathetic nervous system.\n\nWhich neurotransmitter is released by the vagus nerve?\nA) Serotonin\nB) Angiotensin\nC) Prostaglandin\nD) Histamine\n\nAnswer: D) Histamine",
