                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStudent: What is the Bezold-Jarisch reflex?\n\nProfessor: The Bezold-Jarisch reflex is a reflex that is triggered by a decrease in blood pressure. It causes an increase in heart rate and a decrease in blood flow to the heart.\n\nStudent: What mediates the Bezold-Jarisch reflex?\n\nProfessor: The Bezold-Jarisch reflex is mediated by histamine. Histamine is a chemical released by the body in response to a decrease in blood pressure. It causes an increase in heart rate and a decrease in blood flow to the heart. So the answer is D) Histamine.",
