                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "D) Tension in the muscle. I'm glad you now have a better understanding of the role of the Golgi tendon organ and muscle spindles in voluntary movements. If you have any more questions, feel free to ask!",
                                "answer_from_choices": "D",
