                                "answer": "D) Saturation of Oxygen. Good job working through each option and understanding their importance in resuscitation management. Remember, it's crucial to monitor all these parameters, but oxygen saturation is the best guide to ensure adequate oxygenation and overall patient stability during resuscitation.",
