                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nQuestion: What is the best guide for the management of Resuscitation?\n\nAnswer: D) Saturation of Oxygen.\n\nExplanation: Resuscitation is the process of restoring life to a person who has stopped breathing or whose heart has stopped beating. The best guide for the management of Resuscitation is the saturation of oxygen, as oxygen is essential for life and is necessary for the body to function properly. Oxygen saturation is a measure of how much oxygen is in the blood, and monitoring oxygen saturation can help guide the management of resuscitation.",
