                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Resuscitation is the management of a person who is unconscious, injured, or ill. Resuscitation is a medical procedure. Resuscitation is a medical procedure. The best guide for the management of resuscitation is D. So, the answer is D.",
