                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nThe natural disaster causing the maximum deaths is Meterological. Meterological disasters include hurricanes, tornadoes, floods, and other extreme weather events. These disasters can cause significant destruction and loss of life. For example, in 2020, Hurricane Laura caused over 80 deaths in the United States and over 100 deaths in Haiti. In addition, floods in India in 2020 caused over 200 deaths. Therefore, Meterological disasters are the natural disasters that cause the most deaths.",
