                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": " \n\nStep 1: The patient has altered sensorium, so we need to do tests to determine the cause. \n\nStep 2: The tests that should be done in this case are: Complete blood counts, Random blood sugar, Lumbar puncture, and Non-contrast CT head. \n\nStep 3: The answer is D) Non-contrast CT head.",
