                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nA complete blood count is a test that is used to determine the number of red blood cells, white blood cells, and platelets in the blood. A lumbar puncture is a test that is used to determine the pressure of the cerebrospinal fluid and to obtain a sample of the fluid for testing. A non-contrast CT head is a test that is used to determine if there is any bleeding in the brain.\n\nTherefore, the final answer is C.",
