                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStep 1: Understand the question.\nThe question is asking which of the following factors does not increase the risk of lactic acidosis when taking metformin.\n\nStep 2: Read through the answer choices.\nA) Advanced age\nB) Smoking\nC) Liver dysfunction\nD) Renal failure\n\nStep 3: Analyze the answer choices.\nAdvanced age, smoking, and liver dysfunction are all factors that can increase the risk of lactic acidosis when taking metformin. Renal failure is the only answer choice that does not increase the risk of lactic acidosis when taking metformin.\n\nStep 4: Answer the question.\nThe correct answer is D) Renal failure.",
