                        "cot": "Let's derive the differential diagnosis step by step: \n\nFirst pass metabolism will be bypassed by the following routes of drug administration except: \n\nA) Oral \nB) Intravenous \nC) Sublingual \nD) Intradermal\n\nThe answer is A) Oral.",
