                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Step 1: Understand the concept of hepatic first-pass metabolism.\nHepatic first-pass metabolism refers to the process where a drug is metabolized in the liver before it reaches systemic circulation. This can lead to a significant reduction in the drug's concentration and efficacy.\n\nStep 2: Identify the routes of drug administration that bypass hepatic first-pass metabolism.\nTo bypass hepatic first-pass metabolism, a drug must be administered in a way that allows it to enter systemic circulation without passing through the liver first. This can be achieved through various routes of administration, such as intravenous, sublingual, and intradermal.\n\nStep 3: Analyze the given options and determine which one does not bypass hepatic first-pass metabolism.\nA) Oral - Drugs administered orally are absorbed through the gastrointestinal tract and then pass through the liver before entering systemic circulation. Therefore, oral administration does not bypass hepatic first-pass metabolism.\nB) Intravenous - Drugs administered intravenously are directly introduced into the bloodstream, bypassing the liver and avoiding hepatic first-pass metabolism.\nC) Sublingual - Drugs administered sublingually are absorbed through the mucous membranes under the tongue and enter systemic circulation directly, bypassing the liver and avoiding hepatic first-pass metabolism.\nD) Intradermal - Drugs administered intradermally are introduced into the skin layers and are absorbed directly into the bloodstream, bypassing the liver and avoiding hepatic first-pass metabolism.\n\nAnswer: The route of drug administration that does not bypass hepatic first-pass metabolism is A) Oral.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "ac505856-36f5-4397-bab3-a29c58d3fa7c",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "A) Oral.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "A",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
