                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Hepatic First pass metabolism is the process by which drugs are metabolized in the liver. Intravenous administration of drugs bypasses the liver. Intradermal administration of drugs bypasses the liver. So, the answer is D.",
