                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nStudent: What should be done with an IOL placed in a young male after 10 years?\n\nProfessor: There are four possible options: removing the IOL in case of posterior capsule ossification, never removing the IOL, removing the IOL when presbyopia sets in, or changing the IOL after 10 years.",
