                    "2-6 years.",
                    "7-12 years."
                ],
                "context": "",
                "cot": [
                    "According to Piaget Cognitive theory, the sequence of development has been categorized into 4 major stages:\n\nSensorimotor stage (0 to 2 yrs)\nPre-operational stage (2 to 6 yrs)\nConcrete operation stage (7 to 12 yrs)\nFormal operation stage (11 to 15 yrs)"
                ],
                "answer": [
                    "2-6 years."
                ],
                "generated_cot": [
