                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nThe relevant information to answer the above question is: Piaget's theory of cognitive development has four stages. The first stage is the sensorimotor stage, which is from birth to 2 years old. The second stage is the preoperational stage, which is from 2 to 7 years old. The third stage is the concrete operational stage, which is from 7 to 12 years old. The fourth stage is the formal operational stage, which is from 12 years old onwards.\nSo, the answer is C.",
