                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nQ: A child with tetralogy of fallot uses which of the following positions?\n\nA) Supine\nB) Prone\nC) Squatting\nD) Leaning forwards\n\nA) Supine: This position is not recommended for a child with tetralogy of fallot because it can cause the blood to pool in the lungs and make it difficult to breathe.\n\nB) Prone: This position is not recommended for a child with tetralogy of fallot because it can cause the blood to pool in the lungs and make it difficult to breathe.\n\nC) Squatting: This position is recommended for a child with tetralogy of fallot because it helps to open up the lungs and make it easier to breathe.\n\nD) Leaning forwards: This position is not recommended for a child with tetralogy of fallot because it can cause the blood to pool in the lungs and make it difficult to breathe.",
