                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "B) Anterior cruciate ligament. A positive pivot shift test in the knee is caused by an injury to the anterior cruciate ligament.",
