                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nPlan:\n\n1. Understand what a positive pivot shift test is.\n\n2. Research what type of injury is associated with a positive pivot shift test.\n\n3. Compare the options given to the injury associated with a positive pivot shift test.\n\nAnswer: B) Anterior cruciate ligament",
