                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nQuestion: How does decaying vegetation enable energy production?\n\nAnswer: D) enables windmills to power electric grids.\n\nExplanation: Decaying vegetation releases methane gas, which can be used to power wind turbines and generate electricity. This electricity can then be used to power electric grids.",
