                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nDecaying vegetation is part of the process of decomposition, which is the breakdown of organic matter by bacteria and fungi. Decomposition releases energy in the form of heat, which can be used to generate electricity.\n\nWhich of the following uses decomposition to generate electricity?\nA) Nuclear power\nB) Light beams\nC) Gas powered motors\nD) Windmills\n\nAnswer: D) Windmills",
