                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Decaying vegetation is part of the process that enables gas powered motors to operate.\n\nCritique: The answer is not entirely accurate, as decaying vegetation contributes to the formation of fossil fuels like coal, oil, and natural gas, which can be used to power gas engines. However, the process of decaying vegetation itself does not directly enable gas powered motors to operate.\n\nReconsidering the answer options:\nA) Decaying vegetation does not have a direct connection to nuclear power.\nB) Decaying vegetation does not enable the emitting of light beams.\nC) Decaying vegetation contributes to the formation of fossil fuels, which can be used in gas powered motors.\nD) Decaying vegetation does not have a direct connection to windmills powering electric grids.\n\nFinal answer: Decaying vegetation contributes to the formation of fossil fuels, which can be used in gas powered motors (C).",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "5d517d8c-e67d-451c-be3f-9609d232a9f4",
