                        "cot": "Student: I'm not sure which option is the correct example of hunting. Can you help me understand each option better?\n\nProfessor: Of course! Let's go through each option one by one. Option A is \"humans throwing a spear through an animal.\" What do you think about this option?\n\nStudent: Well, it seems like hunting because they are trying to catch an animal for food.\n\nProfessor: That's correct. Now let's look at option B, \"humans chewing on boiled animal muscles.\" What are your thoughts on this one?\n\nStudent: It doesn't sound like hunting because they are already eating the animal.\n\nProfessor: Exactly, option B is not an example of hunting, but rather consuming the result of hunting. Now, let's move on to option C, \"humans gathering animals in a gate.\" What do you think?\n\nStudent: I'm not sure. It sounds like they are trying to catch animals, but I don't know if that's considered hunting.\n\nProfessor: Good observation. While it does involve capturing animals, this option is more related to herding or corralling animals, which is different from hunting. Finally, let's look at option D, \"humans plucking fruit from a tree.\" What are your thoughts on this one?\n\nStudent: That doesn't sound like hunting because they are not trying to catch an animal.\n\nProfessor: Correct! So, based on our discussion, which option do you think is the correct example of hunting?\n\nStudent: I think option A, \"humans throwing a spear through an animal,\" is the correct example of hunting.\n\nProfessor: That's right! Good job working through each option to arrive at the correct answer.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "4a35b975-72b7-423b-9e25-4215b0e08e2e",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
                                "answer_extraction_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}{cot}\n{answer_extraction}",
                                "answer_extraction_text": "",
                                "answer": "A) humans throwing a spear through an animal.",
                                "answer_from_choices": "A",
                                "correct_answer": true
                            }
                        ],
