                        "cot": "\nStep 1: Read the question carefully and identify the four answer choices.\n\nStep 2: Consider each answer choice and determine if it is a possible allergic reaction to medicine.\n\nA) Spider bites: No, this is not an allergic reaction to medicine.\n\nB) Vomiting: Yes, this is a possible allergic reaction to medicine.\n\nC) Placebo effect: No, this is not an allergic reaction to medicine.\n\nD) Dance fever: No, this is not an allergic reaction to medicine.\n\nAnswer: B) Vomiting",
