                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Step 1: Understand the question - The question is asking what useful product can be made from moving winds.\n\nStep 2: Analyze the options - We have four options: wood, bananas, electricity, and metal. We need to determine which of these can be produced using moving winds.\n\nStep 3: Evaluate each option in relation to moving winds:\n\nA) Wood - Wood is a natural material that comes from trees. Moving winds do not produce wood.\nB) Bananas - Bananas are a type of fruit that grow on trees. Moving winds do not produce bananas.\nC) Electricity - Moving winds can be harnessed by wind turbines, which convert the kinetic energy of the wind into electrical energy. This means that electricity can be produced from moving winds.\nD) Metal - Metal is a material that is extracted from the earth and refined through various processes. Moving winds do not produce metal.\n\nStep 4: Choose the correct answer - Based on the evaluation of each option, the correct answer is C) electricity, as it is the only product that can be made from moving winds.",
