                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nStep 1: Read the question and options carefully.\n\nStep 2: Identify the key information in the question - resources decreasing in an environment.\n\nStep 3: Analyze each option to determine which one is the most appropriate answer.\n\nOption A: \"Induces organisms to use more of their resources\" - This option suggests that organisms will use more resources when they are decreasing. However, this does not seem logical as organisms would want to conserve their resources when they are decreasing.\n\nOption B: \"Causes an increase in use of resources\" - This option is similar to option A and suggests that organisms will use more resources when they are decreasing. Again, this does not seem logical.\n\nOption C: \"Causes an uptick in birthrate\" - This option suggests that when resources are decreasing, organisms will have more offspring. While this may be true in some cases, it is not a general rule.\n\nOption D: \"Induces organisms to be more economical with resources\" - This option seems to be the most appropriate answer. When resources are decreasing, organisms will want to conserve their resources and use them more efficiently.\n\nStep 4: Select the most appropriate answer - Option D.\n\nAnswer: D) induces organisms to be more economical with resources.",
