                        "cot": "\n\nThe correct answer is C) keep things random.\n\nWhen it comes to planting crops, farmers will often plant different crops in their fields from year to year in order to keep things random. This helps to prevent pests and diseases from becoming a problem, as they are less likely to build up resistance to a crop if they are only exposed to it every few years. Additionally, this practice can also help to improve soil fertility.",
