                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nThe process of worms returning nutrients from dead organisms to the soil by eating them is known as decomposition. Decomposition is a natural process that happens when organic matter, like dead plants and animals, breaks down into simpler organic matter. This process is important because it recycles nutrients back into the soil that can be used by plants to grow.",
