                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "How can we observe the impact of wind on sand?\n\nA) Sand is in constant motion.\nB) Sandstorms cause sand to form ripples.\nC) Sand is easily displaced by wind.\nD) Beaches often have sand formations shaped by waves.\n\nTo see how wind affects sand, we can observe sand formations created by wind, such as ripples caused by sandstorms or waves on beaches. Therefore, options B and D are correct. Option A is too general and does not specifically address the impact of wind. Option C is true but does not directly answer the question.",
