                        "cot": "\n\nTo see how wind affects sand, we can look at how sand moves when there is wind. Sand is always moving when there is wind, and we can see this by looking at how sandstorms create ripples in the sand. We can also see how wind affects sand by looking at how sand is easy to move through. Beaches often have waves in the sand, and this is because of the wind.",
