                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nA) sand is always moving\nB) sandstorms create ripples in sand\nC) sand is easy to move through\nD) beaches often have waves in the sand\n\nAll of these factors contribute to how wind affects sand. Sand is constantly in motion due to the wind, which can create ripples or patterns in the sand. Additionally, because sand is easy to move through, the wind can easily pick it up and carry it away. Finally, beaches often have waves in the sand because of the wind.",
