                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStep 1: Observe the environment. Look for patterns in the sand, such as ripples or waves.\n\nStep 2: Measure the wind speed. Use a wind meter or anemometer to measure the wind speed.\n\nStep 3: Observe the sand movement. Watch how the sand moves in response to the wind.\n\nStep 4: Analyze the data. Compare the wind speed to the amount of sand movement.\n\nStep 5: Draw conclusions. Determine how wind affects sand movement and how this can be used to understand the environment.",
