                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nPlan:\n1. Gather materials: sand, wind source (fan, wind tunnel, etc.), measuring device (ruler, tape measure, etc.), and a camera or video recorder.\n2. Set up the wind source and measuring device in a large, open area.\n3. Place the sand in the area and measure the area of the sand.\n4. Turn on the wind source and record the effects of the wind on the sand with the camera or video recorder.\n5. Measure the area of the sand after the wind has blown on it.\n6. Compare the measurements of the sand before and after the wind has blown on it.\n\nAnswer: We can see how wind effects sand by measuring the area of the sand before and after the wind has blown on it.",
                        "answers": [
