                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStudent: How can we see how wind effects sand?\n\nProfessor: Well, the wind can cause sand to move in a few different ways. A) The wind can cause sand to always be in motion, even when it's not in a sandstorm. B) When there is a sandstorm, the wind can create ripples in the sand. C) The wind can also make it easier for sand to move through the air. And D) the wind can create waves in the sand on beaches. Does that make sense?\n\nStudent: Yes, that makes sense. Thank you!",
