                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Student: Professor, I'm a bit confused about the question. Can you explain it to me again?\n\nProfessor: Sure, the question is about how a sailor can navigate to the shore.\n\nStudent: Oh, I see. So, what's the correct answer?\n\nProfessor: Well, the correct answer is not D, taking the afternoon off. That's just a distractor. The correct answer is either A, B, or C.\n\nStudent: Okay, can you explain each option to me?\n\nProfessor: Sure. Option A, closing the sails quickly, is not the correct answer because it would slow down the boat and make it harder to reach the shore. Option B, setting out to sea, is also not the correct answer because it would take the sailor further away from the shore. That leaves us with option C, making an adjustment to the rudder, which is the correct answer. By adjusting the rudder, the sailor can change the direction of the boat and steer it towards the shore.\n\nStudent: I see. That makes sense. Thank you, professor.\n\nProfessor: You're welcome. Do you have any other questions?",
