                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Student: Professor, can you explain to me if deserts are characterized by high sunshine?\n\nProfessor: Yes, of course. Deserts are known for their high sunshine. \n\nStudent: How much sunshine do they get?\n\nProfessor: On average, deserts receive about 10 hours of sunshine per day.\n\nStudent: So, does that mean they get surplus sun?\n\nProfessor: Yes, that's correct. Deserts get surplus sun.\n\nStudent: What about places that are always cloudy, are they considered deserts?\n\nProfessor: No, deserts are not always cloudy. In fact, they are known for their clear skies and lack of cloud cover.\n\nStudent: So, deserts get little sun?\n\nProfessor: No, that's not correct. Deserts get a lot of sun, as we discussed earlier. \n\nStudent: Oh, I see. Thank you for explaining that to me, professor.",
