                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Step 1: Understand the question - The question is asking if deserts are known for having a lot of sunshine.\n\nStep 2: Recall the characteristics of deserts - Deserts are typically known for their dry and arid climates, with very little precipitation. They often have extreme temperature fluctuations between day and night, and they generally receive a lot of sunlight during the day.\n\nStep 3: Evaluate the answer choices - \nA) they get low sunlight - This statement contradicts the general understanding of deserts, so it is not the correct answer.\nB) deserts get surplus sun - This statement aligns with the general understanding of deserts, so it could be the correct answer.\nC) deserts get little sun - This statement contradicts the general understanding of deserts, so it is not the correct answer.\nD) deserts are always cloudy - This statement contradicts the general understanding of deserts, so it is not the correct answer.\n\nStep 4: Choose the best answer - Based on the evaluation of the answer choices, the best answer is B) deserts get surplus sun.",
