                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStep 1: Identify the purpose of the reflector. In this case, the purpose of the reflector is to make me more visible while running at night.\n\nStep 2: Consider the materials that could be used to create a reflector. A reflector needs to be able to reflect light, so materials that are reflective or light-colored are ideal.\n\nStep 3: Consider the options given. Option A (a black shirt) is not reflective and would not be suitable for this purpose. Option B (kitchen foil) is reflective and could be used as a reflector. Option C (sunglasses) is not reflective and would not be suitable for this purpose. Option D (a megaphone) is not reflective and would not be suitable for this purpose.\n\nAnswer: B) Kitchen foil",
