                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nThe correct answer is B) Kitchen foil.\n\nTo arrive at this answer, I first considered the purpose of a reflector. A reflector is an object that reflects light, so it can be used to make a person more visible in the dark.\n\nNext, I considered the options given. A black shirt would not be a good reflector because black absorbs light, rather than reflecting it. Sunglasses would also not be a good reflector because they are designed to block light, not reflect it. A megaphone would not be a good reflector because it is not designed to reflect light.\n\nThis leaves kitchen foil as the only option that could potentially be used as a reflector. Kitchen foil is made of metal, which is a good reflector of light. Therefore, kitchen foil is the best option for a reflector when running at night.",
