                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nE) A reflective vest\n\nThe question is asking what can be used as a reflector when running at night. A reflector is an object that reflects light, making it easier to be seen in the dark. \n\nSub-questions:\n1. What materials reflect light?\n2. What materials are lightweight and easy to carry while running?\n\nAnswer:\nThe best option for a reflector when running at night is a reflective vest. Reflective vests are made of a material that reflects light, making it easier to be seen in the dark. Additionally, reflective vests are lightweight and easy to carry while running. Therefore, the best answer is E) A reflective vest.",
