                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nStudent: What can I use as a reflector if I want to go running at night?\n\nProfessor: You can use a variety of items as a reflector. For example, you could use a reflective vest, reflective tape, or a reflective belt. You could also use kitchen foil, sunglasses, or a megaphone. \n\nStudent: So, kitchen foil, sunglasses, and a megaphone can all be used as reflectors?\n\nProfessor: Yes, that's correct. Kitchen foil, sunglasses, and a megaphone can all be used as reflectors. However, it's important to note that a black shirt cannot be used as a reflector.",
