                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Echolocation is a method of detecting the location of an object. The distance of an object can be detected by measuring the time it takes for the echo to return. The time it takes for the echo to return is a function of the object's distance. So, the answer is C).",
