                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": " \n\nEcholocation is the use of sound waves to detect objects. \n\nA) Distance: You can use echolocation to detect how far away an object is. \nB) Shape: You can use echolocation to detect the shape of an object. \nC) Size: You can use echolocation to detect the size of an object. \nD) Temperature: You can't use echolocation to detect the temperature of an object.",
