                        "cot": "\nStep 1: Determine what Fe stands for.\nFe stands for Iron, which is a chemical element.\n\nStep 2: Look up the atomic number of Iron.\nThe atomic number of Iron is 26.\n\nStep 3: Compare the answer to the choices given.\nThe answer is B) atomic 26.",
