                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\nQuestion: Is a nail Fe atomic 12?\n\nStep 1: We need to understand what Fe stands for. Fe is the chemical symbol for iron, so the nail is made of iron.\n\nStep 2: We need to understand what atomic 12 means. Atomic 12 refers to the number of protons in the nucleus of an atom. Iron has 26 protons, so the answer is no, a nail Fe is not atomic 12.\n\nAnswer: D) atomic 12",
