                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Rephrased question: What are the sources of pollen and seeds?\n\nStep-by-step reasoning:\n\nA) Lakes that are frozen over: This option is unlikely as frozen lakes do not produce pollen or seeds.\n\nB) Things you give a loved one in a bouquet: This option is referring to flowers, which do produce pollen and seeds.\n\nC) Various types of animals: While some animals do produce pollen and seeds, it is not a primary function of their biology.\n\nD) A person that is healthy: This option is unrelated to the production of pollen and seeds.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B) things you give a loved one in a bouquet, as flowers are a common source of pollen and seeds.",
                        "answers": [
